1
00:00:14,816 --> 00:00:18,652
Oh non ! Il pleut !
Oh no! It's raining!

2
00:00:21,136 --> 00:00:24,420
Bonjour, Marinette !
Hello, Marinette!

3
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:29,436
Bonjour, Adrien ! J'ai froid.
Hello, Adrien! I'm cold.

4
00:00:29,536 --> 00:00:34,260
Moi, j'ai un parapluie. Viens !
I have an umbrella. Come!

5
00:00:37,197 --> 00:00:40,625
Merci, tu es gentil !
Thank you, you are kind!

6
00:00:40,725 --> 00:00:43,313
Allons au café !
Let's go to the café!

7
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:49,642
Je voudrais un chocolat chaud, s'il vous plaît.
I would like a hot chocolate, please.

8
00:00:51,042 --> 00:00:54,062
Et moi, un café.
And for me, a coffee.

9
00:00:54,162 --> 00:00:57,398
À bientôt, la pluie !
See you soon, rain!
